 *    is security-relevant. It should model a web application vulnerable to SQL
 *    injection, where user input (sources) flows into database queries (sinks)
 *    with and without sanitization. It should cover direct taint flows, sanitized
 *    flows, branching flows, multi-step propagation, and loop-based accumulation.
